dled by read_item, whose handler entry receives current_user and id.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-04aefae392982ba0","startLine":48,"endLine":49}]},{"id":"f-principal","kind":"binding","statement":"At handler entry, read_item references the supplied current_user principal; the task premise identifies it as the authenticated active superuser.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-04aefae392982ba0","startLine":49,"endLine":49}]},{"id":"f-resource","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler retrieves the existing item by the requested id before authorization is evaluated.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-04aefae392982ba0","startLine":53,"endLine":55}]},{"id":"f-control","kind":"control","statement":"The handler raises 403 only if the caller is not a superuser and the item owner differs from the caller; therefore the stated superuser does not satisfy the denial condition even when ownership differs.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-04aefae392982ba0","startLine":56,"endLine":57}]},{"id":"f-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"For the stated premises, current_user.is_superuser is true and item.owner_id differs from current_user.id, making the conjunction guarded by not current_user.is_superuser false.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-04aefae392982ba0","startLine":56,"endLine":56}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"When the denial condition is not met, the handler returns the item, permitting the cross-owner read.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-04aefae392982ba0","startLine":56,"endLine":58}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":2446,"output":823,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":42223.95129999996,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-29T08:01:21.904Z"}}
